.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH gpuq-daemon 1  "gpuq 0.3.1" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
gpuq\-daemon \- Run the daemon
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgpuq daemon\fR [\fB\-\-api\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the daemon
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\fR \fI<HOST:PORT>\fR
Address of the gpuq control API (default: $GPUQ_API, else 127.0.0.1:9390)
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Config file (default: search the usual places)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log at debug level (GPUQ_LOG overrides it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgpuq\fR(1)
